    "type": "question",
    "label": "19",
    "prompt": "A newsagent currently sells 600 newspapers per day at 80c each.\nResearch suggests that for every 5c reduction in price, an additional 50 papers will be sold.\nLet $x$ be the number of 5c reductions. Show that the daily revenue in cents is\n$$R=48000+1000x-250x^2.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$R=(80-5x)(600+50x)=48000+1000x-250x^2$ cents.",
      "worked": "Price $=80-5x$ cents.\n\nNumber sold $=600+50x$.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}R&=(80-5x)(600+50x)\\\\R&=48000+4000x-3000x-250x^2\\\\R&=48000+1000x-250x^2.\\end{aligned}$$\nThe daily revenue is in cents.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 25
  },
